Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhat software do you use when recording videos?\u0026nbsp;Do you have experience editing videos?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eI use bandicam to record videos.\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eI indeed do have experience video editing with Pinnacle Studios 17, Wondershare Video Editor, Adobe Premiere Pro CC 2015, Adobe After Effects CC 2015 (Still learning, but I have some experience and basic knowledge) and most importantly ofc, Windows Movie Maker.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eHave you ever advertised using YouTube?\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eI guess making Avicus videos is indirectly advertising Avicus, no?\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eIf not, I have. When I started more into video editing I made an advertisement for a local clothing store I guess.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eHave you ever marketed something using Youtube before?\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eOther Minecraft servers I was working on I guess. Never took the time into ACTUALLY making those trailers tho.\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhat changes would you like to see made on the Youtube team?\u003c/b\u003e Other than do something? Yeah, I'd so something. I've had a plan in my head, but never got around to doing it.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eHow active are you/how is your work ethic?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eWell I'm on my PC everyday, so that's a +. Don't really go on the server anymore but I'd be willing to go on if needed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eMy work ethic is great if I'm doing what I like. This seems like a position I would like.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eHire me because I like bagged milk. Thank you. I rest my case your honor.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin: 0pt 0px;